{"abstract":"Denne artikel handler om individuelle forskelle i intelligens og om, hvordan de har væsentlig betydning for, hvor længe vi lever. Forskellene har vist sig at være relativt stabile, også i det sene voksenliv. Indholdet er baseret på dele af en artikel, vi for nyligt udgav i tidsskriftet Psyke & Logos (Larsen, Pacak-Vedel & Christoffersen, 2022).","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Lars","Christoffersen, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-728478"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"individuelle intelligensforskelle og overlevelse i det sene voksenliv","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-728478","ids":["au-ca533351-0e68-4e7a-bb87-5e2c03a6d316"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-67D6F2301D5927CECCEA2992536BF685"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"7bd13f67-d81b-40d2-a742-8115e7100ecb","name":"Larsen, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-1603-0311","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"christoffersenpau","last":"Christoffersen","locid":"cc69f65a-9162-4ebe-8585-b2b3ac5f762d","name":"Christoffersen, Morten","orcid":"0000-0002-9423-4654","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["25963945"],"is