{"abstract":"En retlig og teologisk analyse af præsters tjenestepligter - forvaltningsretligt, kirkeretligt og teologisk. 18 bidragydere, hvoraf hovedparten er universitetsforskere.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christoffersen, Lisbet","Martensen-Larsen, Martin","Kjærgaard, Lars Chr"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-679952"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Kirkeministeriet"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"præstens tjenstlige forpligtelser kirkerettens retskilder fra reformationen til nu kirkeretsantologi 000000002023","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.eksistensen.dk/boger/praestens-tjenstlige-forpligtelser-kirkeretsantologi-2023.html","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-679952","ids":["ruc-d6438ce6-3330-4e86-81f9-9ae58a915064"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FD92B22173FEB2F1921684E48ED4C249"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Kirkeministeriet"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Lisbet","key":"christoffersenped","last":"Christoffersen","locid":"1916b569-fdd0-4f6c-a7dd-1d106397f8e0","name":"Christoffersen, Lisbet","orcid":"0000-0002-8102-3727","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","first":"Martin","key":"martensenlarsenped","last":"Martensen-Larsen","name":"Martensen-Larsen, Martin","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lars Chr","key":"kjærgaardped","last":"Kjærgaard","name":"Kjærgaard, Lars Chr","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788741009988"],"pages":"326","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Eksistensen Akademisk","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-d6438ce6-3330-4e86-81f9-9ae58a915064"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Præstens tjenstlige forpligtelser : Kirkerettens retskilder – fra Reformationen til nu. Kirkeretsantologi 2023","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-679952","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Background The optimal repair of ventral hernia remains unknown. We aimed to evaluate the results after robotic-assisted laparoscopic transabdominal repair with retrorectus mesh placement (rRetrorectus) compared with laparoscopic intraperitoneal onlay mesh repair (IPOM) for patients with small- or medium-sized ventral hernia. Methods This was a retrospective cohort study of consecutive patients undergoing elective rRetrorectus or IPOM repair for small or medium-sized primary ventral or incisional hernias. The primary outcome was the postoperative need for transverse abdominis plane (TAP) block or epidural analgesia, secondary outcomes were length of stay and postoperative complications. All patients were followed for 30 days postoperatively. Results A total of 59 patients were included undergoing rRetrorectus (n = 27) and IPOM (n = 32). Patients in the two groups were comparable in terms of age, sex, comorbidities, smoking status, body mass index (BMI), and type of hernia. The median fascial defect area was slightly larger in the rRetrorectus group (9 cm(2) vs. 6.2 cm(2), P = 0.031). The duration of surgery was longer for rRetrorectus (median 117.2 min. vs. 84.4, P = 0.003), whereas the postoperative need for TAP block or epidural analgesia was less after rRetrorectus compared with IPOM (3.7% versus 43.7%, P = 0.002). There were no severe complications or reoperations after either procedure. The length of stay was shorter after rRetrorectus (median 0 vs. 1 day, P < 0.001). Conclusions rRetrorectus was associated with reduced postoperative analgesic requirement and shorter length of stay compared with laparoscopic IPOM. Registration Clinicaltrial.gov: NCT05320055.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Christoffersen, Mette W.","Jørgensen, Lars Nannestad","Jensen, Kristian K."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-445632"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Closure","Hernia repair","IPOM","Incisional hernia","Length of Stay","Postoperative pain","Ventral hernia"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"less postoperative pain and shorter length of stay after robot assisted retrorectus hernia repair rretrorectus compared with laparoscopic intraperitoneal onlay mesh repair ipom for small or medium sized ventral hernias","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-445632","identifier":[{"id":"36109358","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000854704400003","type":"wos"},{"id":"85138074336","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-57555e49-bb3d-449d-a89d-dac7363c35c0"],"keyword":["CLOSURE","Hernia repair","INCISIONAL HERNIA","IPOM","Length of stay","Postoperative pain","Robotic-assisted","Ventral hernia"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CDBF8E477E1752665C6DD72ABB8FC4B6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Surgery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Mette W.","key":"christoffersenpau","last":"Christoffersen","name":"Christoffersen, Mette W.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lars N.","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"ae2a79a1-5374-4e92-84c9-3af55ef5712e","name":"Jørgensen, Lars Nannestad","name_org":"Jørgensen, Lars N.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kristian K.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"cf0c3470-b93a-415c-ba19-aae2c6111c3d","name":"Jensen, Kristian K.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36109358"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00464-022-09608-w","issn":["09302794","14322218"],"issn_org":["09302794"],"issue":"2","journal":"Surgical Endoscopy","pages":"1053-1059","status":"p","title":"Surgical Endoscopy","volume":"37"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85138074336"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-57555e49-bb3d-449d-a89d-dac7363c35c0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Less postoperative pain and shorter length of stay after robot-assisted retrorectus hernia repair (rRetrorectus) compared with laparoscopic intraperitoneal onlay mesh repair (IPOM) for small or medium-sized ventral hernias","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-445632","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
