"name":"Nielsen, Xiaohui C.","rank":83,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian H.","key":"schouwchristianhoth","last":"Schouw","name":"Schouw, Christian H.","rank":84,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"jensenandersoth","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Anders","rank":85,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ea S.","key":"marmolineasoth","last":"Marmolin","name":"Marmolin, Ea S.","rank":86,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"John E.","key":"coiajohneoth","last":"Coia","name":"Coia, John E.","rank":87,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorte T.","key":"andersendortetoth","last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Dorte T.","rank":88,"role":"Other","rolecode":"oth"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mads","key":"albertsenmadspau","last":"Albertsen","locid":"6c728ec9-5a0d-40c7-b3f3-1741c6e01ccc","name":"Albertsen, Mads","orcid":"0000-0002-6151-190X","rank":89,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["35505393"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1186/s13073-022-01045-7","issn":["1756994X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Genome Medicine","paperid":"47","publisher":"BioMed Central Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Genome Medicine","volume":"14"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85129997318"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e1d96822-d59b-45a3-b51f-6e36f19b02d1","dtu-d4ee83d3-1835-45e8-ad47-e535115bd0ce","ku-51b0d01b-2672-480d-b31c-e83ffa63c4d4","sdu-43413a40-3fef-478a-bbab-354d2e418a06"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Introduction and transmission of SARS-CoV-2 lineage B.1.1.7, Alpha variant, in Denmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S04-093.49-010787","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Context: Blood lipid levels are linked to the risk of cardiovascular disease and regulated by genetic factors. A low-frequency polymorphism Arg82Cys (rs72836561) in the membrane protein nepmucin, encoded by CD300LG, is associated with lower fasting concentration of high-density lipoprotein cholesterol (HDLc) and higher fasting triglycerides. However, whether the variant is linked to postprandial lipids and glycemic status remains elusive. Objective: Here, we augment the genetic effect of Arg82Cys on fasting plasma concentrations of HDL subclasses, postprandial lipemia after a standardized high-fat meal, and glycemic status to further untangle its role in HDL metabolism. Methods: We elucidated fasting associations with HDL subclasses in a population-based cohort study (Oxford BioBank, OBB), including 4522 healthy men and women. We investigated fasting and postprandial consequences on HDL metabolism in recall-by-genotype (RbG) studies (fasting: 20 carrier/20 noncarrier; postprandial: 7 carrier/17 noncarrier), and shed light on the synergistic interaction with glycemic status. Results: A lower fasting plasma concentration of cholesterol in large HDL particles was found in healthy male carriers of the Cys82 polymorphism compared to noncarriers, both in the OBB (P = .004) and RbG studies (P = .005). In addition, the Cys82 polymorphism was associated with low fasting plasma concentrations of ApoA1 (P = .008) in the OBB cohort. On the contrary, we did not find differences in postprandial lipemia or 2-hour plasma glucose levels. Conclusion: Taken together, our results indicate an association between the Arg82Cys variant and a lower concentration of HDL particles and HDLc, especially in larger HDL subclasses, suggesting a link between nepmucin and HDLc metabolism or maturation.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Metz, Sophia","Krarup, Nikolaj T","Bryrup, Thomas","Støy, Julie","Andersson, Ehm A","Christoffersen, Christina","Neville, Matt J","Christiansen, Malene R","Jonsson, Anna E","Witte, Daniel R","Kampmann, Ulla","Nielsen, Lars Bo","Jørgensen, Niklas R","Karpe, Fredrik","Grarup, Niels","Pedersen, Oluf","Kilpeläinen, Tuomas O","Hansen, Torben"],"cuid":["S04-099.83-822500"],"filters":{"added":"2022-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Hansen, Torben"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Oxford Centre for Diabetes, Endocrinology & Metabolism","Oxford Centre for Diabetes, Endocrinology, and Metabolism","University of Oxford"],"keyword":["Apolipoproteins","Cholesterol transport","Cohort profile","Heterogeneity","Human Genetics","Ischemic heart disease","Lipid Metabolism","MEN","Metabolism","NONFASTING TRIGLYCERIDES","Particle Size","Plasma","Risk","Triglycerides","WIDE ASSOCIATION","density lipoprotein cholesterol"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the arg000000000082cys polymorphism of the protein nepmucin implies a role in hdl metabolism","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1210/jendso/bvac034","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S04-099.83-822500","identifier":[{"id":"35382499","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8974852","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"000777268200001","type":"wos"},{"id":"85128413066","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f28f834d-bd60-4637-a538-c99056f9a57d","au-9702f0e9-ef6b-4d96-99ae-3104521ecf55","ku-22a3896f-c6f2-4606-8c5f-d1c46331cc4e","sdu-3537f828-434e-496d-ad70-e07ae8451cbd"],"keyword":["COH