te Brandt","key":"sørensencharlottebrandtpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"14bfd3d1-a9b2-4bc5-823b-233432e43cf3","name":"Sørensen, Charlotte Brandt","orcid":"0000-0002-4469-8696","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30062172"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jacbts.2017.06.004","issn":["2452302X"],"issue":"5","journal":"JACC: Basic to Translational Science","pages":"591-600","publisher":"Elsevier Inc.","status":"p","title":"JACC: Basic to Translational Science","title_org":"JACC: Basic to translational science","volume":"2"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85042148702"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-26f6d550-083e-470e-bc41-ac22fd927e38","dtu-f6640060-bc9d-450c-95a2-24901023646a","ku-90709418-18fb-4095-a438-4df8d102d6b5"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Apolipoprotein E Deficiency Increases Remnant Lipoproteins and Accelerates Progressive Atherosclerosis, But Not Xanthoma Formation, in Gene-Modified Minipigs","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-088.14-666129","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND AND PURPOSE: Phosphodiesterase 1 (PDE1), a subfamily of cyclic nucleotide phosphodiesterases consisting of three isoforms, PDE1A, PDE1B, and PDE1C, has been implicated in regulation of vascular tone. The PDE1 isoform(s) responsible for tone regulation is unknown. This study used isoform-preferring PDE1 inhibitors, Lu AF58027, Lu AF64196, Lu AF66896, and Lu AF67897, to investigate the relative contribution of PDE1 isoforms to regulation of vascular tone. EXPERIMENTAL APPROACH: In rat mesenteric arteries, expression and localisation of Pde1 isoforms were determined by qPCR and in situ hybridisation, and physiological impact of PDE1 inhibition were evaluated by isometric tension recordings. KEY RESULTS: In rat mesenteric arteries, Pde1a mRNA expression was higher than Pde1b and Pde1c. In situ hybridisation revealed localisation of Pde1a to vascular smooth muscle cells (VSMC) and only minor appearance of Pde1b and Pde1c. The potency of the PDE1 inhibitors in eliciting relaxation showed excellent correlation with their potency of PDE1A inhibition. Thus, Lu AF58027 exhibited highest potency at inhibiting PDE1A (IC50 = 4 nM) and was also most potent at eliciting relaxation in mesenteric arteries (EC50 = 32 nM). Inhibition of NOS with L-NAME, soluble GC with ODQ, or PKG with Rp-8-Br-PET-cGMP all attenuated PDE1 inhibition-induced relaxation, whereas PKA inhibition with H89 had no effect. CONCLUSION AND IMPLICATIONS: Pde1a was the dominant PDE1 isoform present in VSMC and relaxation mediated by PDE1A-inhibition was predominantly driven by enhanced cGMP signalling. These results imply that isoform-selective PDE1 inhibitors are powerful investigative tools allowing examination of physiological and pathological roles of PDE1 isoforms.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Khammy, Makhala Michell","Dalsgaard, Thomas","Larsen, Peter Hjorringgaard","Christoffersen, Claus Tornby","Clausen, Dorte","Rasmussen, Lars Kyhn","Folkersen, Lasse","Grunnet, Morten","Kehler, Jan","Aalkjær, Christian","Nielsen, Jacob"],"cuid":["S02-087.97-026984"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Dalsgaard, Thomas"],"keyword":["Blood Pressure","Cell growth","Endothelium","Guanylate Cyclase","Nitric oxide","Pharmacology","Protein kinase","Up Regulation","Vascular smooth muscle"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-LUND"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-LUND","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"phosphodiesterase 000000000001a inhibition elicits cgmp dependent relaxation of rat mesenteric arteries","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85031433593","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-087.97-026984","identifier":[{"id":"85031433593","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28910498","type":"pmid"},{"id":"000417545500021","type":"wos"},{"id":"PMC5659990","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-c576fef1-2165-458e-9108-022b37214f78","ku-dc822a53-c2dd-4553-8cb7-5e7402fbe3fe"],"keyword":["BLOOD-PRESSURE","CELL GROWTH","CYCLIC-NUCLEOTIDE PHOSPHODIESTERASES","ENDOTHELIUM","GUANYLATE-CYCLASE","NITRIC-OXIDE","PHARMACOLOGY","PROTEIN-KINASE","UP-REGULATION","VASCULAR SMOOTH-MUSCLE"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-5DD5670C11B940A3262A2406206BE23A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Biomedicine, Department of Biomedicine - Forskning og uddannelse, Vest"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"lundbeck","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-LUND","l3nl":"Lundbeck Pharma","l3nn":"Lundbeck","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Lundbeck","namevar":["Lundbeck Pharma A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-LUND","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Makhala Michell","key":"khammypau","last":"Khammy","locid":"d40c6737-c8a2-47b6-9aad-048d3b8e6c5d","name":"Khammy, Makhala Michell","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"dalsgaardpau","last":"Dalsgaard","locid":"7cac860b-0bba-4de4-966f-6a630c6e5e1a","name":"Dalsgaard, Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Hjorringgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Peter Hjorringgaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus Tornby","key":"christoffersenpau","last":"Christoffersen","name":"Christoffersen, Claus Tornby","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Dorte","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","name":"Clausen, Dorte","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Kyhn","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Lars Kyhn","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Lasse","key":"folkersenpau","last":"Folkersen","name":"Folkersen, Lasse","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"grunnetpau","last":"Grunnet","name":"Grunnet, Morten","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"kehlerpau","last":"Kehler","name":"Kehler, Jan","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"aalkjærpau","last":"Aalkjær","locid":"5432bf4e-2402-4f9d-9c5b-d44af26ac406","name":"Aalkjær, Christian","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christian","key":"aalkjaerpau","last":"Aalkjaer","locid":"6518fe5a-9c3b-4720-b573-f7711c0e581a","name":"Aalkjaer, Christian","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jacob","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28910498"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/bph.14034","issn":["00071188","13595075"],"issn_org":["00071188"],"issue":"22","journal":"British Journal of Pharmacology","pages":"4186-4198","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"British Journal of Pharmacology","volume":"174"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85031433593"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Lundbeck Pharma","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c576fef1-2165-458e-9108-022b37214f78","ku-dc822a53-c2dd-4553-8cb7-5e7402fbe3fe"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Phosphodiesterase 1a inhibition elicits cGMP-dependent relaxation of rat mesenteric arteries","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-087.97-026984","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Well leg compartment syndrome (WLCS) is a complication to abdominal surgery. We aimed to identify risk factors for and outcome of WLCS in Denmark and literature. METHODS: Prospectively collected claims to the Danish Patient Compensation Association (DPCA) concerning WLCS after abdominal operations 1996-2013 and cases in literature 1970-2013 were evaluated. Cases of fasciotomy within 2 weeks after abdominal surgery 1999-2008 were extracted from the Danish National Patient Register (DNPR). RESULTS: There were 40 cases in DPCA and 124 in literature. In 68 % legs were supported under the knees during surgery. Symptoms of WLCS presented within 2 h after surgery in 56 % and in only 3 cases after 24 h. Obesity was not confirmed as risk factor for WLCS. The mean diagnostic delay was 10 h. One-third of fasciotomies were insufficient. The diagnostic delay increased with duration of the abdominal surgery (p = 0.04). Duration of the abdominal surgery was 4 times as important as the diagnostic delay for severity of the final outcome. DNPR recorded 4 new cases/year, and half were reported to DPCA. CONCLUSION: The first 24 h following abdominal surgery of >4 h' duration with elevated legs observation for WLCS should be standard. Pain in the calf is indicative of WLCS, and elevated serum CK can support the diagnosis. Mannitol infusion and acute four-compartment fasciotomy of the lower leg is the treatment. The risk of severe outcome of WLCS increases with duration of the primary operation. A broad support and change of legs' position during surgery are suggested preventative initiatives.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Christoffersen, Jens Krogh","Hove, Lars Dahlgaard","Mikkelsen, Kim Lyngby","Krogsgaard, Michael Rindom"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-468085"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Journal Article"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"well leg compartment syndrome after abdominal surgery","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-468085","identifier":[{"id":"84984863492","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27590466","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-7c9d4a34-42a5-4a64-9321-b3ab840091c9"],"keyword":["Journal Article"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1EBB3B75917F73EC96E6D3CFF9007D1B"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Orthopaedic Surgery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jens Krogh","key":"christoffersenpau","last":"Christoffersen","name":"Christoffersen, Jens Krogh","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars Dahlgaard","key":"hovepau","last":"Hove","name":"Hove, Lars Dahlgaard","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kim Lyngby","key":"mikkelsenpau","last":"Mikkelsen","name":"Mikkelsen, Kim Lyngby","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Michael Rindom","key":"krogsgaardpau","last":"Krogsgaard","locid":"f704dca0-ca86-405a-a7f2-cce1f75f6b8f","name":"Krogsgaard, Michael Rindom","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27590466"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00268-016-3706-8","issn":["03642313","14322323"],"issn_org":["03642313"],"issue":"2","journal":"World Journal of Surgery","pages"