{"abstract":"Congenital hyperinsulinism (CHI) is a rare and heterogenous disease with a challenging diagnostic process and a need of individualised treatment of each patient. In severe, neonatal or infant CHI, differentiation between the focal and diffuse form by rapid genetics, 18F-fluoro-L-dihydroxyphenylalanine positron emission tomography/computed tomography and peroperative microscopy of frozen section allows surgeons to resect the focal lesion instead of performing subtotal pancreatectomy. Milder CHI, sometimes difficult to diagnose, is treated conservatively. In spite of all improvements, cerebral complications are still frequently seen.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Christesen, Henrik Thybo","F. Bruun, Maria","Hedegaard Christoffersen, Stine","Rasmussen, Lars","Petersen, Henrik","Detlefsen, Sönke","Hovendal, Claus","Hansen, Tom Giedsing","Hansen, Tine Plato","Brusgaard, Klaus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-606572"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kongenit hyperinsulinisme diagnostik og behandling","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84857662059","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-606572","identifier":[{"id":"84857662059","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22118585","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-7498ebff-e155-4da2-9bb7-2e913697e43a"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D082A1A5173212356912B47A642B9DF0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Paediatrics (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Thybo","key":"christesenhenrikthybopau","last":"Christesen","locid":"c8317e72-7a09-4c80-81e9-b69855b68e8f","name":"Christesen, Henrik Thybo","orcid":"0000-0001-5330-6853","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria","key":"fbruunmariapau","last":"F. Bruun","locid":"086ec631-2dc0-44a1-a58c-9c6afdf0ba09","name":"F. Bruun, Maria","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Stine","key":"hedegaardchristoffersenstinepau","last":"Hedegaard Christoffersen","name":"Hedegaard Christoffersen, Stine","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"rasmussenlarspau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"9b0464c9-1f26-4fb8-a9e7-85f9155469b0","name":"Rasmussen, Lars","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"petersenhenrikpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"ea635371-4294-4379-9655-3da538fecf13","name":"Petersen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-1118-1500","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sönke","key":"detlefsensönkepau","last":"Detlefsen","locid":"6bbd570e-0f99-4ee0-a239-7433591decbd","name":"Detlefsen, Sönke","orcid":"0000-0002-9466-2333","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Claus","key":"hovendalclauspau","last":"Hovendal","locid":"09aa251b-01ee-4400-8f74-0bc76b426337","name":"Hovendal, Claus","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom Giedsing","key":"hansentomgiedsingpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"5f66539d-cd24-4c21-8e6b-fefbcdcb0032","name":"Hansen, Tom Giedsing","orcid":"0000-0002-5896-9768","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tine Plato","key":"hansentineplatopau","last":"Hansen","locid":"b286e5d2-48e2-452d-b9c6-4d689db9336f","name":"Hansen, Tine Plato","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Klaus","key":"brusgaardklauspau","last":"Brusgaard","locid":"81205519-e2e8-445f-9c7d-d74c189a9ab5","name":"Brusgaard, Klaus","orcid":"0000-0002-2096-4988","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22118585"],"pub":{"issn":["00415782","13994174"],"issn_org":["00415782"],"issue":"47","journal":"Ugeskrift for Læger","pages":"3020-3025","publisher":"Lægeforeningen","status":"p","title":"Ugeskrift for Læger","volume":"173"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84857662059"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-7498ebff-e155-4da2-9bb7-2e913697e43a"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Kongenit hyperinsulinisme - diagnostik og behandling","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-606572","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Coagulation in blood is initiated when coagulation factor VII (FVII) binds to exposed TF and is activated to FVIIa, and the TF/ FVIIa complex may therefore provide a marker of vascular injury potentially applicable in diagnostic imaging of acute gastrointestinal (GI) bleeding. Methods: Recombinant FVIIa (rFVIIa) was radiolabeled with technetium-99m in a direct labeling reaction using the ‘carbonyl approach’ using the IsoLink s carbonyl labeling agent. The properties of 99mTc(CO)3- rFVIIa complex was analyzed by TCA precipitation, HPLC and FVIIa functional integrity was tested in in vitro assays. Results: Labeling of rFVIIa was possible without tagging with a chelater. Incorporation of radioactivity depended strongly on rFVIIa concentration and temperature. More than 95% incorporation was achieved after 30 min at 451C with 0.76 mg/ml rFVIIa. 99mTc(CO)3-rFVIIa was obtained in 46% radiochemical yield and in 495% radiochemical purity. Pull down experiments showed that the biological activity (binding to tissue factor and to anti-FVII antibody) of the radiolabelled product remained intact in the formulation mixture as well as in human serum. By computer modeling analysis, two candidate sites for stabilizing the 99mTc(CO)3 1-ligand structure in FVIIa were identified. Conclusion: Radiolabelled rFVIIa derivatives may represent a novel tool for the diagnosis of acute gastrointestinal bleeding lesions.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Madsen, Jacob","Christensen, Jesper B.","Olsen, Ole H.","Christoffersen, Carsten L.","Petersen, Lars C.","Tranholm, Mikael","Kjaer, Andreas","Hesse, Birger"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-487772"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"recombinant coagulation factor viia labelled with the fac 000000000099 mtc co 000000000003 core synthesis and in vitro evaluation of a putative new radiopharmaceutical for imaging in acute bleeding lesion","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jlcr.1850","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-487772","identifier":[{"id":"79953743554","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-9dd4bfbb-139f-4d6d-8f0a-448bc20848e3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-1E95F8EFB83E2C4EAF078095FF300026"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/jlcr.1850","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Endocrinology and Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Jacob","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","name":"Madsen, Jacob","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jesper B.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Jesper B.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ole H.","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Ole H.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten L.","key":"christoffersenpau","last":"Christoffersen","name":"Christoffersen, Carsten L.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars C.","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","name":"Petersen, Lars C.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mikael","key":"tranholmpau","last":"Tranholm","name":"Tranholm, Mikael","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Andreas","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"23e31554-6330-4153-9443-43d6e2951b3d","name":"Kjaer, Andreas","name_org":"Kjær, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0002-2706-5547","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Birger","key":"hessepau","last":"Hesse","name":"Hesse, Birger","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/jlcr.1850","issn":["03624803","10991344"],"issn_org":["03624803"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of Labelled Compounds and Radiopharmaceuticals","pages":"214-19","status":"p","title":"Journal of Labelled Compounds and Radiopharmaceuticals","volume":"54"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79953743554"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-9dd4bfbb-139f-4d6d-8f0a-448bc20848e3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Recombinant coagulation factor VIIa labelled with the fac-99 mTc(CO)3-core: synthesis and in vitro evaluation of a putative new radiopharmaceutical for imaging in acute bleeding lesion","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-487772","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
